      "text": "[7:47PM] #LekkiPeninsula #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in Lekki Peninsula Scheme 1 is moving smoothly from the gate to Farm City and Road 12.\nLekki-Ikoyi Link bridge roundabout to Alexander Avenue, Roads 13 & 14 on Admiralty Way are also flowing well.\nVFS down to Ikate is still a bit congested, while Freedom Way from Dome to Car Wash is clear.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
